COMPILATION OF: E48C6

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E48C6

   1 a 0000 E48C6:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-48/P2c] THE ORIENTATION, member: `b = ('EOF' = rec.name)'.  [C191]:
   4 a 0006 `literal = member' needs NO XCHG because HL is already the right
   5 a 0006 operand (E29C9 001C: LHLD / LXI D,*S / MVI B / ?SCCVM).  On an
   6 a 0006 automatic member the address materializes directly, so P6 predicts
   7 a 0006 LXI H,*D(rec) / LXI D,*S / MVI B,03 / ?SCCVM -- 16 bytes, the
   8 a 0006 mirror of P5 plus the member cell. */
   9 c 0006   dcl
  10 c 0006     1 rec,
  11 c 0006       2 name character(30) varying;
  12 c 0006   dcl b bit(1) static initial('0'b);
  13 c 0006   rec.name = 'AB';
  14 c 0013   b = ('EOF' = rec.name);
  15 c 0024   put list('B=', b);
  16 c 0046   stop;
  17 a 0049 end E48C6;

CODE SIZE = 0049
DATA AREA = 0027
FREE SYMS = 3877
END  COMPILATION
